.SH NAME
tagents-broadcast - Send message to all idle agents


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtagents broadcast  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Send a message to every idle agent in scope.

.PP
Skips busy and dead agents. Use --runtime to target a specific agent type.
Use --dry-run to preview without sending.

.PP
Examples:
  tagents broadcast "please summarize your current status"
  tagents broadcast "stop" --runtime claude
  tagents broadcast "check in" --all-machines --dry-run


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Show what would be sent without sending

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for broadcast

.PP
\fB--runtime\fP=""
	Filter by runtime: claude or codex


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--all-machines\fP[=false]
